#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/spatial_methods/finite-volumes.ipynb:51
msgid "Setting up a Discretisation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/spatial_methods/finite-volumes.ipynb:62
msgid ""
"We first import ``pybamm`` and some useful other modules, and change our "
"working directory to the root of the ``PyBaMM`` folder:"
